<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There on the cross your burden upbearing,</l><l>Thorns on His brow your Savior is wearing;</l><l>Never again your sin need appall,</l><l>You have been pardoned once for all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now we are free—there’s no condemnation;</l><l>Jesus provides a perfect salvation:</l><l>“Come unto Me,” oh, hear His sweet call,</l><l>Come, and He saves us once for all.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Children of God—oh, glorious calling,</l><l>Surely His grace will keep us from falling;</l><l>Passing from death to life at His call,</l><l>Blessed salvation once for all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
